  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WBU Green Biofuels in Ukraine: Production and Testing and Port City Territories Laboratory for Inclusive Energy Transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To catalyse the development of a thriving and equitable green biofuel industry in Ukraine, focusing on the transport and maritime sectors, by: (1) conducting in-depth market research and outlining the potential for sustainable biofuel production and utilisation, (2) bridging expertise: exchange of practices between Danish and Ukrainian stakeholders to drive innovation in Ukraine and knowledge sharing, and (3) facilitating the green transition of Ukrainian ports to reduce environmental impact, create local economic opportunities, and enhance energy security for communities dependent on these vital transportation hubs.</narrative>
  </description>
